0..60 Comment "//! This source defines a first-order model of `theory Nat`."
61..64 Comment "//!"
65..120 Comment "//! A first-order model is an algebra for its signature"
121..214 Comment "//! [Kaposi-2024-secondorder_generalised_algebraic_theories_signatures_firstorder_semantics]."
215..218 Comment "//!"
219..291 Comment "//! The model provides one carrier for each sort. The model provides one"
292..324 Comment "//! function for each operation."
325..404 Comment "//! A source model of `Nat` has a record type. The syntax model, counting model"
405..451 Comment "//! and `Model(Nat)` module inhabit that type."
